<title>MALAYSIA: Amway shares debut at 12.50 ringgit.</title>
<headline>Amway shares debut at 12.50 ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Amway (Malaysia) Holdings Bhd on Friday made their market debut at 12.50 ringgit against an offer price of 6.00 ringgit.</p>
<p>The consumer products seller made a public issue of 13.795 million shares for its listing on the main board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>After about 10 minutes, the stock was trading at 13.00 ringgit on volume of 2.73 million shares.</p>
<p>Amway forecast net earnings per share of 56.79 cents for the year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>At 12.50 ringgit, its price-to-earnings ratio is 22 times, slightly higher than that for most main board stocks.</p>
</text>
